      "kind": "code",
      "block": true,
      "language": "python",
      "text": "def fibonacci_generator(n):\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        yield a\n        a, b = b, a + b\n\n\nfor num in fibonacci_generator(10):\n    print(num)"
